      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T21:23:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s use modern C++ libraries for time: `\u003cchrono\u003e`. Please see Stream code for an example: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:hardware/interfaces/audio/aidl/default/include/core-impl/Stream.h;l\u003d202;drc\u003d6f3474a98ea107c25b0666361668e788bbbf0ca2",
